{"anomaly_threshold":75,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：短时间成功认证次数异常升高。对应需求：登录审计 / 疑似喷洒或爆破后成功。","false_positives":["构建服务器与 CI 的集中认证","安全测试窗口内的爆破演练"],"from":"now-30m","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["auth_high_count_logon_events_ea"],"name":"【默认】双端登录成功事件激增（机器学习）","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"d7d5c059-c19a-4a96-8ae3-41496ef3bcf9","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 双端","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: 登录审计"],"type":"machine_learning","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n成功登录事件数量相对基线出现尖峰。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是密码喷洒、账号枚举或爆破后批量成功。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对时间窗内成功账号与源地址。\n2. 区分 CI/发布系统与真实用户。\n3. 关联失败登录与新建会话。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1110","name":"Brute Force","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1110.003","name":"Password Spraying","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"version":210,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customi